WEBVTT

00:10.860 --> 00:13.050
Where is everyone?

00:24.670 --> 00:25.700
Himeno...

00:25.700 --> 00:26.740
Who are you?!

00:26.740 --> 00:30.200
Himeno, you can't win against me.

00:30.740 --> 00:32.210
No! Go away!

00:33.850 --> 00:34.970
Himeno...

00:35.150 --> 00:37.580
No!

01:34.170 --> 01:36.310
What are you doing?!

01:36.310 --> 01:37.940
What am I doing? I was just...

01:37.940 --> 01:40.510
I don't have those kind of feelings for you, okay?!

01:40.510 --> 01:42.550
Dummy! That's not it!

01:42.550 --> 01:44.610
Then what is it?

01:45.150 --> 01:47.280
Well, that is to say...

01:48.350 --> 01:50.550
No, nothing.

01:53.460 --> 01:54.450
Get out!

02:00.800 --> 02:01.770
Idiot.

02:05.700 --> 02:08.970
The boundless future stretches across the skies

02:05.700 --> 02:08.970
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

02:08.970 --> 02:13.010
And I am reborn anew

02:08.970 --> 02:13.010
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:13.010 --> 02:20.030
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:13.010 --> 02:20.030
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:24.080 --> 02:24.280
Prétear

02:32.260 --> 02:39.170
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

02:32.260 --> 02:39.170
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

02:39.170 --> 02:43.960
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

02:39.170 --> 02:43.960
kimerareta ashita wa nai

02:46.010 --> 02:52.910
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

02:46.010 --> 02:52.910
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

02:52.910 --> 02:57.820
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

02:52.910 --> 02:57.820
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

02:59.650 --> 03:03.520
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

02:59.650 --> 03:03.520
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

03:03.520 --> 03:06.660
If the cold wind glimmers

03:03.520 --> 03:06.660
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

03:06.660 --> 03:12.430
I can hear your voice drifting gently

03:06.660 --> 03:12.430
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

03:12.600 --> 03:12.900
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

03:12.600 --> 03:17.370
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

03:17.370 --> 03:19.910
Warms it so much that it hurts

03:17.370 --> 03:19.910
kono mune o atsuku suru

03:19.910 --> 03:22.640
It all begins from the point of believing

03:19.910 --> 03:22.640
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

03:22.640 --> 03:26.310
These feelings are proof of being alive

03:22.640 --> 03:26.310
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

03:26.310 --> 03:26.610
The endless future and the expanding skies

03:26.310 --> 03:29.520
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

03:29.520 --> 03:33.550
Allow me to be reborn anew

03:29.520 --> 03:33.550
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

03:33.550 --> 03:39.660
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

03:33.550 --> 03:39.660
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

03:39.660 --> 03:44.260
Holding hands with you

03:39.660 --> 03:46.260
sono te tsunaide

03:46.440 --> 03:49.810
Smile of Darkness

03:51.640 --> 03:53.270
Late, late, late, late, late!

03:53.850 --> 03:55.570
I'm late!

03:56.450 --> 03:57.280
Yo...

04:08.360 --> 04:09.120
Is he here?

04:14.070 --> 04:14.870
He's here.

04:14.870 --> 04:15.860
Just as I thought...

04:20.170 --> 04:21.100
He's still here.

04:24.640 --> 04:29.010
He's surely truly in love with you!

04:29.510 --> 04:32.180
But he can't be honest and say it!

04:32.720 --> 04:36.690
Asleep or awake, 24 hours a day, he can only think about you!

04:37.060 --> 04:40.820
Even if it's a love which won't come true, he just can't give it up!

04:41.260 --> 04:44.960
Like a werewolf, he cries tears of solitude on the night of a full moon!

04:45.360 --> 04:45.950
Himeno!

04:46.460 --> 04:49.020
Why don't you accept his feelings for you?

04:49.300 --> 04:50.030
Why not?

04:50.700 --> 04:52.900
You have to be kidding!

04:52.900 --> 04:54.570
Next, Miss Awayuki.

04:54.570 --> 04:55.570
Yes!

04:55.570 --> 04:57.230
Why should I have to...

04:57.980 --> 05:01.340
...end up with him like that?!

05:03.450 --> 05:04.310
Amazing!

05:07.150 --> 05:08.120
Himeno!

05:13.090 --> 05:15.620
It's a sand beauty salon, right?

05:16.060 --> 05:16.860
You...

05:18.560 --> 05:21.500
It's been a while since I've seen you with a smile like that.

05:21.500 --> 05:22.670
Sasame...

05:22.670 --> 05:24.640
Why are you sticking so close to Himeno?

05:25.270 --> 05:26.240
No reason.

05:27.070 --> 05:29.040
Has the Princess of Disaster begun to move?

05:29.570 --> 05:30.710
No.

05:30.710 --> 05:31.830
I see.

05:32.840 --> 05:34.900
That's fine, then.

05:36.850 --> 05:39.480
Well, I'm sorry to have caused trouble.

06:03.940 --> 06:06.170
What's his deal, anyway?!

06:07.450 --> 06:09.000
If I come this way, then...

06:10.150 --> 06:11.210
Lost him.

06:14.750 --> 06:16.050
A demon larva?

06:16.050 --> 06:17.660
No, it's different.

06:17.660 --> 06:19.280
Something I haven't felt before.

06:20.360 --> 06:20.920
Hey!

06:21.460 --> 06:22.460
What?

06:22.460 --> 06:24.330
Hey! Let go!

06:26.460 --> 06:28.260
The darkness is on the move! Let's go!

06:29.670 --> 06:30.870
That Yayoi!

06:30.870 --> 06:33.770
"Love of a werewolf which will never come true," my ass!

06:40.210 --> 06:41.280
The flowers!

06:41.280 --> 06:42.980
Their Leafe has been sucked dry!

06:42.980 --> 06:45.210
It's near! Be careful!

06:48.150 --> 06:49.120
What the...

06:49.120 --> 06:50.320
Familiars!

06:50.320 --> 06:53.360
They're underlings who carry Leafe to the Princess of Disaster!

06:53.360 --> 06:56.490
Since they move about, they're a lot harder to deal with than demon larvae!

06:56.490 --> 06:59.960
To think the Princess of Disaster can now command familiars...

06:59.960 --> 07:00.620
Damn!

07:06.400 --> 07:07.270
What?!

07:16.150 --> 07:18.210
Oh, man, they escaped!

07:19.520 --> 07:20.610
I...

07:22.020 --> 07:23.820
I've seen those before.

07:25.060 --> 07:26.660
Those familiars...

07:26.660 --> 07:29.430
Last night, they were in my dream.

07:29.430 --> 07:30.360
In your dream?

07:30.360 --> 07:33.460
Could this be contact with the Princess of Disaster?

07:33.460 --> 07:34.670
I see...

07:34.670 --> 07:37.470
Hayate, you knew about that, didn't you?

07:37.470 --> 07:40.070
That's why you spent all day guarding Himeno.

07:40.070 --> 07:41.770
Say what?! Wait a minute!

07:42.370 --> 07:44.180
Guarding?

07:44.180 --> 07:45.910
What's the meaning of this?

07:45.910 --> 07:48.710
You did that without even discussing it with us.

07:49.550 --> 07:52.150
You were guarding me?

07:52.150 --> 07:53.250
Then, even last night...

07:53.250 --> 07:54.450
What? Last night?!

07:54.450 --> 07:56.150
What do you mean, last night?!

07:56.150 --> 07:57.820
<i>I want to guard her too!</i>

07:57.820 --> 07:59.560
<i>Shut up! Kids should stay quiet!</i>

07:59.560 --> 08:00.860
<i>Stop treating me like a kid!</i>

08:00.860 --> 08:02.430
<i>Idiot! Last night means it was at night!</i>

08:02.430 --> 08:03.660
<i>I'm going to guard her too!</i>

08:03.660 --> 08:04.660
<i>Me too!</i>

08:04.660 --> 08:06.060
<i>I'm telling you, it was at night!</i>

08:06.060 --> 08:08.570
<i>Then let's pick an order and go on a rotation.</i>

08:08.570 --> 08:09.470
Hayate!

08:09.470 --> 08:11.630
You were doing your own thing again.

08:12.200 --> 08:14.470
Drop it. Let's just pick an order.

08:15.470 --> 08:16.010
Haya...

08:16.010 --> 08:17.410
<i>All right! Let's decide with rock, paper, scissors!</i>

08:17.410 --> 08:18.180
<i>You're on!</i>

08:18.180 --> 08:19.280
<i>It's rock!</i>

08:19.280 --> 08:20.380
<i>That's paper!</i>

08:20.380 --> 08:21.980
Himeno...

08:20.380 --> 08:21.180
<i>Go, paper...</i>

08:21.980 --> 08:22.680
<i>Give it up!</i>

08:22.680 --> 08:24.640
Let's give some Leafe to the townspeople.

08:22.680 --> 08:23.980
<i>Oh, be quiet!</i>

08:25.480 --> 08:26.550
Yes, let's.

08:26.550 --> 08:27.420
Are you all right?

08:27.420 --> 08:29.320
Yes, I am.

08:38.400 --> 08:39.360
It's still not enough.

08:39.860 --> 08:41.330
Not enough yet.

08:42.970 --> 08:45.030
I need more Leafe.

08:46.770 --> 08:47.900
More...

08:49.670 --> 08:50.970
<i>More...</i>

08:52.680 --> 08:56.180
That's right, Natsue isn't here.

08:56.180 --> 08:58.110
So you haven't seen her either.

08:59.550 --> 09:01.650
Mr. Awayuki, where should I put this?

09:01.650 --> 09:04.360
Oh, put that in reception room three.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.120
All right.

09:10.230 --> 09:14.320
I guess it would be better for me to apologize, wouldn't it, Mom?

09:16.870 --> 09:18.560
I'm first...

09:28.850 --> 09:31.910
He did say reception room three.

09:32.620 --> 09:33.410
Here?

09:45.960 --> 09:47.970
Well, that is...

09:47.970 --> 09:49.470
Sorry about today.

09:49.470 --> 09:53.270
I thought you had turned into a stalker or something.

09:53.810 --> 09:58.380
If you were protecting me as a Knight, you could have told me that.

09:58.380 --> 10:00.280
If you had told me, then I wouldn't have...

10:00.280 --> 10:01.400
Stalker?

10:02.880 --> 10:04.640
Dad?!

10:05.420 --> 10:08.720
Why are you in reception room three?!

10:08.720 --> 10:10.660
This is reception room five.

10:10.660 --> 10:11.660
No way.

10:11.660 --> 10:12.320
It's true.

10:12.320 --> 10:13.590
I see. See ya!

10:15.860 --> 10:17.730
Hey, could that be...

10:19.760 --> 10:21.160
This is...

10:21.230 --> 10:23.000
Himeno Mark 2

10:24.000 --> 10:27.970
<i>And so, that concludes "Sasame's Words Gate."</i>

10:27.970 --> 10:29.130
<i>Goodnight.</i>

10:34.110 --> 10:36.510
<i>For God's sake! Please, Himeno!</i>

10:36.510 --> 10:39.450
What's with this Himeno Mark 2?!

10:39.450 --> 10:43.220
What the hell do you think of your own daughter's head, anyway?!

10:41.850 --> 10:43.220
I'm telling you, Tulip!

10:43.760 --> 10:44.810
Punishment!

10:49.630 --> 10:51.190
Justice prevails!

10:52.860 --> 10:55.470
I have no idea what they're doing!

10:55.470 --> 10:58.270
I can hardly understand their father-daughter relationship!

10:58.270 --> 10:59.740
Really? It's wonderful.

11:00.870 --> 11:02.270
Hey, wait, Mawata!

11:04.080 --> 11:06.840
Wonderful? Where?

11:07.330 --> 11:07.410
Takoyaki

11:07.780 --> 11:09.800
It's about time for my guard shift.

11:25.330 --> 11:27.060
It's slightly hot.

11:27.060 --> 11:28.400
I'm sorry!

11:29.470 --> 11:31.770
Hey, you...

11:33.270 --> 11:34.260
Are you all right?

11:35.010 --> 11:35.970
Oh, my...

11:38.280 --> 11:41.040
I see, your name is Sasame.

11:41.680 --> 11:43.380
Be grateful to me.

11:43.380 --> 11:46.080
I'm forgiving you despite the fact you tossed...

11:46.080 --> 11:50.050
...spicy, sauce-covered takoyaki all over me in the hallway of my mansion.

11:50.050 --> 11:51.320
I'm really sorry.

11:53.060 --> 11:55.560
Now Sasame will fall head over heels in love with me.

11:55.560 --> 11:56.960
It's a little daring,

11:56.960 --> 12:00.450
but for a gentle man like him, this is an effective plan.

12:03.470 --> 12:05.130
He's not here either.

12:05.670 --> 12:06.730
Miss Himeno?

12:07.910 --> 12:08.870
Mikage!

12:09.370 --> 12:11.510
What are you doing in a place like this?

12:11.510 --> 12:14.280
Oh, nothing. How about yourself?

12:14.280 --> 12:18.340
It's getting cold tonight so I brought an extra blanket.

12:18.880 --> 12:19.920
Thank you!

12:19.920 --> 12:22.410
I'll take it to your room.

12:26.020 --> 12:26.920
No, no!

12:27.330 --> 12:27.860
No?

12:27.860 --> 12:30.260
I'll take it myself!

12:30.260 --> 12:32.630
But I'll be scolded.

12:32.630 --> 12:34.070
It's okay already!

12:34.070 --> 12:37.730
I'll keep this between us. Trust me.

12:38.370 --> 12:40.740
I see, well, excuse me.

12:43.880 --> 12:44.840
What?

12:45.910 --> 12:46.980
A blackout?

12:46.980 --> 12:48.480
What the?!

12:48.480 --> 12:50.450
What's going on?!

12:51.150 --> 12:52.810
If it's this dark, then I can't take a shower.

12:53.750 --> 12:54.650
Dark?

12:54.650 --> 12:57.090
Wait, while I'm at it, I might as well...

12:58.960 --> 13:00.320
Oh, Sasame!

13:00.320 --> 13:01.660
I'm scared of the dark!

13:01.660 --> 13:02.630
Wow!

13:03.760 --> 13:06.200
That's such a crude exclamation coming from you, Sasame.

13:07.630 --> 13:08.370
This...

13:08.370 --> 13:10.030
This slick sensation is...

13:10.570 --> 13:11.330
It can't be!

13:11.870 --> 13:13.930
Mr. Sasame has left.

13:14.710 --> 13:16.070
<i>Tanaka!</i>

13:26.180 --> 13:27.480
A demon larva!

13:28.120 --> 13:28.950
Himeno!

13:29.390 --> 13:30.890
Hayate, where...

13:30.890 --> 13:32.860
This time, it's quite a distance from here.

13:32.860 --> 13:35.460
It's some place completely separate from this blackout area.

13:35.460 --> 13:36.830
Can you feel it?

13:36.830 --> 13:39.060
If we get closer, probably.

13:39.060 --> 13:40.260
All right.

13:40.260 --> 13:41.490
Let's search from the sky.

13:45.270 --> 13:46.330
So warm...

13:48.070 --> 13:48.770
Let's go!

13:50.170 --> 13:52.480
Stop wobbling around! If you fall, I'm not picking you up!

13:52.480 --> 13:54.780
Why is that the only way you can say things?!

13:54.780 --> 13:56.370
How can you call yourself a Knight?!

14:03.620 --> 14:04.620
Mannen!

14:04.620 --> 14:06.060
Mannen, wake up!

14:06.060 --> 14:07.420
Wake up!

14:09.560 --> 14:10.820
Where did Himeno go?

14:13.970 --> 14:15.830
Himeno?

14:16.200 --> 14:17.000
Hey...

14:19.540 --> 14:21.030
Are you sure it's here?

14:25.410 --> 14:27.880
How long were you planning on holding it, anyway?!

14:31.880 --> 14:33.110
This place is...

14:45.360 --> 14:46.020
No...

14:47.470 --> 14:48.470
What is it?

14:48.470 --> 14:49.400
Himeno...

14:51.670 --> 14:52.730
Fenrir!

14:55.470 --> 14:56.740
The Princess of Disaster?!

14:59.280 --> 15:01.740
So this is the way, Tipi?

15:04.120 --> 15:07.180
Hayate's with Himeno?

15:07.180 --> 15:09.780
Since he wasn't in the mansion, probably.

15:11.890 --> 15:13.360
Himeno!

15:23.870 --> 15:24.670
Hold it!

15:24.670 --> 15:27.070
Wait! I'll go too! Hayate!

15:27.070 --> 15:28.570
Hayate? Where are you?

15:28.570 --> 15:29.230
Hayate!

15:30.680 --> 15:31.680
Bright!

15:31.680 --> 15:33.040
What?

15:53.360 --> 15:54.830
I wanted to see you.

15:56.230 --> 15:58.600
So, the blackout was to draw me out.

15:59.170 --> 16:01.400
Why did you shield that woman?

16:02.770 --> 16:04.870
Because she's the Prétear.

16:07.810 --> 16:10.580
Enough already! What good will come of all of this?!

16:12.720 --> 16:13.740
Hayate....

16:26.560 --> 16:27.530
Takako!

16:28.770 --> 16:30.270
Hurry and go to her.

16:30.270 --> 16:33.070
If you don't, your precious Prétear will...

16:33.070 --> 16:34.300
What?! Himeno!

16:57.460 --> 16:59.930
So they sucked up all the city's electricity?

17:02.830 --> 17:03.870
Himeno!

17:03.870 --> 17:04.970
Are you all right?!

17:04.970 --> 17:06.170
Are you hurt?

17:06.170 --> 17:07.360
Himeno!

17:08.570 --> 17:10.060
Thanks, everyone.

17:11.410 --> 17:12.930
Thank you too, Tipi.

17:13.610 --> 17:14.480
Himeno!

17:14.480 --> 17:15.480
Hayate...

17:15.480 --> 17:18.580
You idiot! Where the hell did you go and leave Himeno alone?!

17:18.580 --> 17:19.180
Wait!

17:19.180 --> 17:20.450
We'll talk later! It's coming!

17:22.220 --> 17:23.590
All right, Himeno!

17:23.590 --> 17:25.190
Let's handle this with my hot power.

17:25.190 --> 17:26.190
Wait!

17:26.190 --> 17:29.730
I fell asleep earlier when I was supposed to be guarding you, so...

17:29.730 --> 17:30.720
With me?

17:34.060 --> 17:35.090
Thank you.

18:11.970 --> 18:13.300
<i>Beyondios!</i>

18:35.690 --> 18:37.160
We did it!

18:44.770 --> 18:45.470
Damn you!

18:45.470 --> 18:47.870
Relax! There's only one enemy!

18:47.870 --> 18:49.270
You don't give me orders!

18:49.270 --> 18:50.170
Say what?!

18:50.170 --> 18:51.370
This is no time to be fighting amongst ourselves!

18:51.810 --> 18:52.410
Himeno!

18:52.410 --> 18:54.070
Got it! Cover me!

19:01.790 --> 19:02.720
Now, Himeno!

19:02.720 --> 19:04.550
Ice Arquebus!

19:11.860 --> 19:13.420
Go!

19:25.780 --> 19:26.940
We did it!

19:30.480 --> 19:31.450
Why?!

19:38.190 --> 19:39.620
The attacks stopped?

19:39.620 --> 19:40.320
Why?

19:41.160 --> 19:42.720
What's going on?

19:46.530 --> 19:47.460
Fenrir!

19:47.460 --> 19:49.330
I can't watch this any longer.

19:54.270 --> 19:55.400
Wow!

19:55.840 --> 19:56.970
What power!

19:56.970 --> 19:57.940
Himeno...

19:58.480 --> 20:02.740
It looks like it wasn't necessary to warn you in your dreams.

20:03.480 --> 20:06.880
With so little ability, there's no way you can win.

20:06.880 --> 20:10.980
But if you insist on fighting, prepare to die.

20:27.570 --> 20:30.730
It looks like your persuasions didn't go over too well.

20:33.580 --> 20:35.550
I guess we have no choice but to fight.

20:40.720 --> 20:41.880
Hayate?

20:45.820 --> 20:48.160
He's not here.

21:04.680 --> 21:07.540
He's not here when I want him to be.

21:08.850 --> 21:10.540
Prepare to die.

21:17.220 --> 21:18.650
I'm scared...

21:23.190 --> 21:28.890
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.190 --> 21:28.890
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:28.890 --> 21:33.130
The stars shine in the night sky

21:28.890 --> 21:33.130
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.130 --> 21:39.000
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.130 --> 21:39.000
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.000 --> 21:41.870
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.000 --> 21:41.870
katte na jinkusu

21:41.870 --> 21:47.850
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:41.870 --> 21:47.850
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
ashita wa egao de

21:51.820 --> 21:57.920
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.820 --> 21:57.920
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:57.920 --> 22:02.230
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:57.920 --> 22:02.230
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.230 --> 22:03.590
My Sweet Heart

22:02.230 --> 22:03.590
My Sweet Heart

22:03.590 --> 22:09.900
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.590 --> 22:09.900
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:09.900 --> 22:13.670
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:09.900 --> 22:13.670
arienai yurusenai

22:13.670 --> 22:20.680
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.670 --> 22:20.680
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.680 --> 22:29.020
